Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.02,0:00:03.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,呀
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.58,0:00:08.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:15.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！不好意思 让我躲一下雨！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.55,0:00:22.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么一下子就这么大雨...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:25.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.28,0:00:27.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？是谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.83,0:00:28.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来这里喵
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.78,0:00:32.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:35.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.67,0:00:39.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.45,0:00:41.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,有人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.17,0:00:49.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,布娃娃？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.29,0:00:55.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是小猫！好可爱...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.14,0:00:55.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（雷鸣）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.42,0:01:07.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带我走喵
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.37,0:01:10.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（雷鸣）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.30,0:01:14.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.77,0:01:17.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,说话了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.99,0:01:25.30,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 不要紧吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.45,0:01:26.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（开门声）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.49,0:01:30.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 刚才那是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:33.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 没被雨淋湿吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.73,0:01:34.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.92,0:01:35.63,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.80,0:01:37.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.16,0:01:40.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,咦！这小娃娃哪来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.70,0:01:41.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.09,0:01:48.22,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.94,0:01:50.95,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.29,0:01:55.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喵喵喵喵喵 为什喵在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.20,0:03:34.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}小晴与被遗忘的布娃娃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.21,0:03:41.13,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,按你说的... 这只布娃娃是一路跟着小晴 一直到我们家来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.40,0:03:42.43,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.63,0:03:44.67,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能有这种事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.90,0:03:48.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我是真的听到有人说“带我走”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.88,0:03:53.19,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得城外的洋房 现在是无人的空房
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.43,0:03:54.26,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.44,0:03:56.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那么小晴听到 声音
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.13,0:04:00.87,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,难道说 是这只布娃娃...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.53,0:04:05.84,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,妖怪！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.02,0:04:08.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.77,0:04:11.31,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴害怕这种鬼怪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.53,0:04:13.85,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,把它送回洋房里去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.17,0:04:18.00,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,诶！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.34,0:04:24.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,呀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.06,0:04:34.45,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,喵喵 喵喵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.79,0:04:49.72,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,喵喵 不怕不怕哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.03,0:05:04.04,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,喵喵 哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.23,0:05:05.43,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.92,0:05:08.99,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,让小空给上了一课呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.62,0:05:13.08,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,无论对方是谁 都要一视同仁！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.32,0:05:18.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我不成熟啊 说的没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.95,0:05:19.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.11,0:05:23.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,“英雄会向任何遇到困难的人 伸出援手！”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.92,0:05:25.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,可我却
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.32,0:05:31.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小猫 我没有体谅你的心情 就逃走了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.41,0:05:33.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.10,0:05:36.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你不嫌弃的话 让我来帮助你吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.28,0:05:41.79,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 该怕还是会怕啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.83,0:05:45.39,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,先帮他洗干净吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.60,0:05:50.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不怕 不怕...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.56,0:05:51.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,要换我来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.81,0:05:52.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不用
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.99,0:05:55.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,说到底 他是跟着我来的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.68,0:06:01.56,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 白白胖胖
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.74,0:06:03.23,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,变干净了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.50,0:06:05.51,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,喵喵 来玩吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.55,0:06:10.58,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 啊哈哈哈啊....
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.75,0:06:12.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真是新颖的玩法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.25,0:06:14.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,接着怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.92,0:06:18.28,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这种时候 应该跟由由阿姨咨询一下...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.57,0:06:22.91,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,因为参加马术俱乐部的远征 早上就出门了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.60,0:06:26.43,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,先调查一下住在那间洋房里的人家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.97,0:06:28.45,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我也来帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.66,0:06:30.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那我也来！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.35,0:06:31.28,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,加油吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.60,0:06:36.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你今天陪小空玩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.69,0:06:42.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.45,0:06:50.95,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空真睡得着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.43,0:06:53.39,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 还在怕吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.68,0:06:55.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,老实说 是有一点...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.69,0:07:00.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,布娃娃是样好东西 抱在怀里能让人很舒心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.43,0:07:01.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.07,0:07:12.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我小时候 满脑子都是修炼啊特训啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.34,0:07:13.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不懂这些...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.42,0:07:21.11,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,布娃娃能够说是最最早交上的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.45,0:07:24.85,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我也有一个很宝贝的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.97,0:07:30.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,朋友...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.81,0:07:44.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.58,0:07:45.98,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.48,0:07:47.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我去追！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.76,0:07:49.82,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,喵喵？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.00,0:07:50.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才的是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.97,0:07:51.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布娃娃？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:52.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞起来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.18,0:07:55.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶 那是猫型的无人机！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.78,0:07:58.56,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 真厉害啊 最新的科技！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.76,0:07:59.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.00,0:08:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.50,0:08:16.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.22,0:08:18.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,一起回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.21,0:08:21.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 抱歉打扰你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.44,0:08:23.28,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,喵喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.43,0:08:24.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.16,0:08:27.69,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小猫？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.22,0:08:32.11,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,今天感觉还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.06,0:08:36.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.97,0:08:48.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？这是...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.61,0:08:51.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,做梦吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.14,0:08:53.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.74,0:08:56.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.72,0:08:58.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,别过意不去 小猫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.53,0:09:01.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我引起骚动了喵
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.13,0:09:06.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系的 能告诉我原因吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.18,0:09:08.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很像呢喵
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.73,0:09:09.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.31,0:09:11.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.04,0:09:22.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论是快乐的时候 还是悲伤的时候 都在一起喵
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.44,0:09:26.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能够永远永远在一起的吧喵
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.37,0:09:29.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.01,0:09:41.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.07,0:09:43.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我变得孤零零的喵
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.46,0:09:46.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好寂寞喵
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.67,0:09:51.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白天的那个小朋友很像她喵
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.11,0:09:54.81,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我去找！肯定能找到！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.38,0:09:57.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,如果没能找到的话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.50,0:10:00.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,没找到的话 我会永远陪着小猫的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.62,0:10:03.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有什么永远喵
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.85,0:10:08.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不能再给你们添麻烦了喵
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.66,0:10:11.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有什么麻烦的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.69,0:10:15.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 谢谢你找到了我 跟我一起玩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.17,0:10:19.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可开心了喵 谢谢喵
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.82,0:10:23.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是回去等她吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.81,0:10:25.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再会了喵
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.61,0:10:29.90,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小猫！诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.91,0:10:35.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.90,0:10:43.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.29,0:10:44.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.25,0:10:45.11,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.27,0:10:46.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小猫...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.88,0:10:50.30,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我这边没找到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.18,0:10:52.48,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我这里也是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.92,0:10:54.87,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,喵喵 没了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.06,0:10:56.63,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,去哪里了呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.90,0:10:58.81,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我去追他...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.95,0:11:04.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟小猫约好了！会帮他找到朋友的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.95,0:11:08.16,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我们去追吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.89,0:11:10.25,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.86,0:11:22.53,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,是Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.46,0:11:33.90,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小猫肯定在那间洋房里！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.47,0:11:36.97,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那间洋房的房主 去年搬家了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.18,0:11:38.87,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,所以一直空置着
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.26,0:11:42.14,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,只是不知道他们一家现在搬去哪里了
