Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.93,0:14:27.87,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,被关起来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.42,0:14:30.69,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,能够毫发无损的出来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.87,0:14:33.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我很担心小猫有没有被牵扯进来！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.50,0:14:35.67,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定在这里面的某处吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.00,0:14:36.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小猫
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.12,0:14:39.08,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是担心猫的时候吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.25,0:14:41.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.18,0:14:43.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
