Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.63,0:14:53.87,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.76,0:15:04.88,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.70,0:15:07.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.14,0:15:10.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,也太大了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.87,0:15:12.35,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办才好啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.53,0:15:13.85,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.03,0:15:14.57,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的话...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.78,0:15:16.09,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
