Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.79,0:15:59.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.20,0:16:04.07,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.17,0:16:09.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.70,0:16:10.72,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.04,0:16:14.89,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.43,0:16:20.63,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.35,0:16:24.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.29,0:16:29.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！这里喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.21,0:16:29.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小猫！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.98,0:16:35.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点... 快点喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.01,0:16:37.94,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.06,0:16:47.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.47,0:16:50.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.86,0:16:53.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小猫 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.44,0:16:55.82,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一起走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.33,0:16:59.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不会再让你感受孤单！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.07,0:17:01.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.99,0:17:09.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里是出口喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.80,0:17:10.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.21,0:17:12.09,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.52,0:17:13.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.65,0:17:14.91,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.09,0:17:15.86,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.03,0:17:17.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.51,0:17:19.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.63,0:17:20.84,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.01,0:17:21.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.98,0:17:22.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.90,0:17:24.48,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不从这里逃出去 就会没完没了的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.66,0:17:26.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那里就是出口！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.87,0:17:29.27,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好！全员全力！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.76,0:17:34.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.44,0:17:35.84,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.04,0:17:38.92,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不会被这种程度的轻易击败啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.92,0:17:41.31,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,终于出来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.55,0:17:43.56,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,一到外面 就是我们的回合了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.94,0:17:45.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.58,0:17:47.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.37,0:17:50.72,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.75,0:17:54.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦啦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.16,0:17:58.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.30,0:18:03.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.76,0:18:08.98,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.21,0:18:10.80,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,出招了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.29,0:18:14.33,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,全色合一！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.62,0:18:15.96,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,融合调色盘！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.62,0:18:15.96,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Mix Palette！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.40,0:18:17.24,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,红色！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.40,0:18:17.24,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Red！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.10,0:18:20.26,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,黄色！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.10,0:18:20.26,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Yellow！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.70,0:18:22.89,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝色！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.70,0:18:22.89,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Blue！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.40,0:18:25.67,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,白色！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.40,0:18:25.67,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}White！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.25,0:18:33.13,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,搅拌搅拌
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.30,0:18:34.81,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,色彩填充！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.30,0:18:34.81,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Colour Charge！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.41,0:18:58.70,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,光美·绚烂彩虹冲击！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.41,0:18:58.70,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Precure Titanic Rainbow Attack！
