Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.42,0:19:05.77,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然开朗
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.42,0:19:05.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然开朗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.30,0:19:12.40,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.67,0:19:14.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,虽为敌人 令人佩服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.73,0:19:16.36,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,弥诺彤彤！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.87,0:19:21.11,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小猫 能够平安找到你 太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.71,0:19:24.85,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经查到住在洋房的人家了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.16,0:19:27.88,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,问题在于要怎么找到他们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.22,0:19:30.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧 我一定会找到的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:35.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理穗 别闷闷不乐的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.04,0:19:38.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定还在的 好不好？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.51,0:19:39.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.29,0:19:41.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你们好...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.67,0:19:42.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.14,0:19:47.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛绒
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.59,0:19:49.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是这只小猫的名字吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.53,0:19:52.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理穗！玛绒 是玛绒！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.22,0:19:53.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.51,0:19:57.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只布娃娃 是她最喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.66,0:19:59.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在搬家的时候给落下了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.36,0:20:03.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们又抽不出时间 回来这边...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.96,0:20:07.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别哭了 理穗 我们找到玛绒了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.27,0:20:20.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,玛绒 没关系的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.15,0:20:27.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.12,0:20:33.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.87,0:20:36.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,“我一直在等你喵"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.25,0:20:46.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛绒！我好想你！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.38,0:20:50.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛绒 对不起 把你落下了...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.51,0:20:53.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以后要永远在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.92,0:20:55.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛绒...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.04,0:21:00.76,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,喵喵 拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.98,0:21:02.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜拜！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.77,0:21:05.73,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,没有寻找物主的必要了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.98,0:21:08.25,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,能够重逢 大团圆！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.79,0:21:11.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 是不是有点难过？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.49,0:21:15.14,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我没关系的！因为玛绒他很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.23,0:21:19.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢喵
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.80,0:21:59.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,布娃娃 真好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.68,0:22:00.87,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.91,0:22:09.22,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Summer！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.91,0:22:09.22,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1070,960)}夏日愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.87,0:22:12.41,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起艳阳高照吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.46,0:23:48.15,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,说到夏天 那就得是大海！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.35,0:23:50.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,晴雯丽 你有见过海吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.37,0:23:51.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,在电视上见过！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.59,0:23:53.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就是有点大的湖吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.58,0:23:54.91,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定会惊讶的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.52,0:23:57.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,很期待小晴的反映呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.19,0:24:00.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.19,0:24:00.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海阔天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.87,0:24:02.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,波澜壮阔的大海！海滨乐园！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.28,0:01:58.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（冲上蓝天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.49,0:02:04.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 超越云巅
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.29,0:02:09.60,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧！向着海阔天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:17.34,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空万里 美丽蓝天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.54,0:02:22.50,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨后初霁天空棱镜折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.74,0:02:26.75,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天的景色预告着有好事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.75,0:02:28.23,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（蓝天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.23,0:02:32.50,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要确认一下 便伸直了双手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.11,0:02:37.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名为希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.17,0:02:39.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速紧握！紧紧握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.20,0:02:43.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,战胜绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.01,0:02:47.60,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.60,0:02:51.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦干眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.65,0:02:51.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已经做好准备了吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:53.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飞跃而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:53.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(让我们张开勇气之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.36,0:02:58.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 朝气蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.97,0:03:03.43,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把烦躁化为光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.68,0:03:08.73,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未来的图景 充满着可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.87,0:03:13.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,与在同一片蓝天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.86,0:03:16.25,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起唤起通向明日的奇迹！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.40,0:03:24.28,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海阔天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
